<section class="opsSection" id="bill-calculator"><div class="appSectionHeading"><div><span class="sectionKicker">CUSTOMER BILL ESTIMATE</span><h2>Electricity bill calculator</h2><p>Enter the usage and charges shown on a customer’s bill to estimate the total.</p></div><span class="sectionCounter">STAFF TOOL · NOT SAVED</span></div><div class="billCalculator"><form id="staffBillForm"><label>Electricity used<input name="usage" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" value="320" inputmode="decimal" required><small>Usage from the bill, in kilowatt-hours (kWh).</small></label><label>Rate per kWh<input name="rate" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="12" inputmode="decimal" required><small>Use the customer’s rate from their latest bill.</small></label><label>Other charges (₱)<input name="charges" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="150" inputmode="decimal"><small>Delivery, transmission, taxes, and other fees.</small></label><label>Credits or discounts (₱)<input name="credits" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="0" inputmode="decimal"><small>Optional credits shown on the bill.</small></label><div class="billCalcResult" aria-live="polite"><span>Estimated bill total</span><strong>₱<output id="billTotal">3,990.00</output></strong><p><span>Energy charge</span><b>₱<output id="energyCharge">3,840.00</output></b></p><p><span>Other charges</span><b>₱<output id="otherCharges">150.00</output></b></p><p><span>Credits and discounts</span><b>− ₱<output id="billCredits">0.00</output></b></p><small>Estimate only. Final amounts depend on the utility bill’s full rate breakdown.</small></div><div class="billCalcActions"><button class="tableButton" type="reset">Restore example</button><button class="primaryCta" type="button" id="copyBillEstimate">Copy estimate</button></div><p class="billCopyMessage" id="billCopyMessage" aria-live="polite"></p></form></div></section>
